    // ---- Gplex for Google Maps (4.1) ------------------------------------------
    // Google's own Maps app keeps running underneath, hidden, and does the searching;
    // Gplex draws the page and its own map on top. The map is Google's map tiles, the
    // flat kind Maps used until 2013, coloured per era through the tile server's own
    // style setting - which is how the old yellow highways come back.
    // Assets are Google's own (the 2005-2013 controls, markers and logos still served
    // from maps.gstatic.com) and, for 2015-2018, the shapes out of the Google Maps UI
    // kit, inlined so nothing depends on them staying online.
    // (a function, not a const: the page code reaches this before a const this far
    // down in the script would exist)
